OL,3,GNEWSAMum who died after BBL tried to   
OL,4,A'find perfection'                      
OL,6,FA "devoted and loving mother" who died 
OL,7,Ffollowing a cosmetic procedure was     
OL,8,F"trying to find elusive perfection",   
OL,9,Fher sister has said.                   
OL,11,FMum-of-five Alice Webb, 33, collapsed  
OL,12,Fat a friend's house in Gloucester on 24
OL,13,FSeptember 2024 and died the following  
OL,14,Fday after having a Brazilian Butt Lift 
OL,15,F(BBL).                                 
OL,17,FJordan Parke, known as the "Lip King", 
OL,18,Fwas under investigation for gross      
OL,19,Fnegligence manslaughter after giving   
OL,20,FWebb seven times the recommended amount
OL,21,Fof filler before she collapsed. He died
OL,22,Fin February 2026.                      
