OL,3,GNEWSAMum who died after BBL tried to   
OL,4,A'find perfection'                      
OL,6,FEarlier, April Palmer told the inquest 
OL,7,Finto her sister's death that "despite  
OL,8,Fbeing naturally beautiful" inside and  
OL,9,Fout, Webb struggled with low self-worth
OL,10,Fand negative remarks "weighed heavily  
OL,11,Fon her".                               
